{"name":"Jaw-chewing with Falim gum 8 hours","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":17,"casual":{"lead":["People chew very hard Turkish gum such as Falim for many hours daily, aiming for a bigger, wider masseter and stronger-looking jaw.","The muscle can enlarge with constant gum chewing, but no trial has tested the practice for appearance. Users report both gains and pain."],"sections":[{"h":"How it works","paras":["Repetitive heavy chewing loads the masseter, which can hypertrophy with heavy use."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks and caveats","paras":["Reported effects include jaw pain, popping, ear-area pressure and excess masseter bulk. Temporomandibular literature lists gum chewing as a suggested but unproven contributor to jaw problems."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Falim gum is utter trash","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/falim-gum-is-utter-trash.55792/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230322214508/https://looksmax.org/threads/falim-gum-is-utter-trash.55792/"},{"title":"falim hurts smth close to my ear","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/falim-hurts-smth-close-to-my-ear.54897/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230327102631/https://looksmax.org/threads/falim-hurts-smth-close-to-my-ear.54897/"},{"title":"Holy shit, falim is live saving","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/holy-shit-falim-is-live-saving.2022112/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260426175150/https://looksmax.org/threads/holy-shit-falim-is-live-saving.2022112/"},{"title":"how to sell 2 kg of falim gum","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/how-to-sell-2-kg-of-falim-gum.1313299/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250424092424/https://looksmax.org/threads/how-to-sell-2-kg-of-falim-gum.1313299/"},{"title":"if you chew 5 falim gum for 3 hours every day for a year","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/if-you-chew-