astic or falim gum which is better","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mastic-or-falim-gum-which-is-better.54940/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230328182534/https://looksmax.org/threads/mastic-or-falim-gum-which-is-better.54940/"},{"title":"things that are shipping to me minoxidil and falim gum","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/things-that-are-shipping-to-me-minoxidil-and-falim-gum.53422/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220814071411/https://looksmax.org/threads/things-that-are-shipping-to-me-minoxidil-and-falim-gum.53422/"},{"title":"insane falim gum tranformation does falim mastic gum just make your masseter muscle bigger or do does it thicken the bones aswell","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/insane-falim-gum-tranformation-does-falim-mastic-gum-just-make-your-masseter-muscle-bigger-or-do-does-it-thicken-the-bones-aswell.12685/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250825075656/https://looksmax.org/threads/insane-falim-gum-tranformation-does-falim-mastic-gum-just-make-your-masseter-muscle-bigger-or-do-does-it-thicken-the-bones-aswell.12685/"},{"title":"is falim gum hard enough","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/is-falim-gum-hard-enough.10121/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250814231312/https://looksmax.org/threads/is-falim-gum-hard-enough.10121/"},{"title":"just got my falim gum","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/just-got-my-falim-gum.3582/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230606041322/https://looksmax.org/threads/just-got-my-falim-gum.3582/"},{"title":"Iran's Latest Struggle","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/irans-latest-struggle/88436","site":"T Nation · 107 posts · 2007"},{"title":"best falim gum flavour","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/best-falim-gum-flavour.1820/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220524123502/https://looksmax.org/threads/best-falim-gum-flavour.1820/"}],"web":[{"title":"Masseter muscle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masseter_muscle"},{"title":"Temporomandibular joint dysfunction","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temporomandibular_joint_dysfunction"}]},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Extended Falim chewing is a practice in looksmaxxing communities in which people chew Falim, a hard Turkish gum, for hours a day, in some accounts up to eight, to enlarge the masseter and widen or strengthen the lower face.","The masseter is known to enlarge with heavy use; clinical descriptions list clenching, bruxism and constant gum chewing as causes of masseter hypertrophy, which can change facial shape and is sometimes linked to temporomandibular joint problems.[1][2] Forum users describe both enlargement they welcome and jaw pain they attribute to long sessions.[3][4]","No clinical trial of marathon chewing for appearance was located for this entry."],"infobox":[["Type","Jaw-exercise practice"],["Product","Falim and similar hard or mastic gums"],["Target","Masseter muscle"],["Evidence for appearance change","Unproven"],["Reported downside","Jaw pain, clicking, muscle overgrowth"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Practitioners chew one or several pieces of hard gum at once, for sessions that users in threads describe as lasting many hours. Some say gum softens too fast and move to stiffer gums or mastic.[3][5]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Beliefs and claims","paras":["Users say the practice widens the face, strengthens the jaw and improves symmetry.[4] Some report enlargement large enough that they sought masseter botulinum toxin injections afterward.[4]","Others report discomfort. One thread describes pressure near the ear, jaw popping when yawning and pain even when eating bread after chewing sessions.[3]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Research and expert views","paras":["Reference sources describe masseter hypertrophy from constant gum chewing, usually painless and bilateral, and note it may be linked to temporomandibular joint problems.[1] Descriptions of temporomandibular disorders list excessive gum chewing among suggested parafunctional habits, but state that no specific evidence supports it and that the role of parafunction is debated.[2]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found. Related background: clinical descriptions of masseter hypertrophy report that constant gum chewing can enlarge the muscle.[1]"],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"On looksmax.org, Falim threads mix reports of visible jaw growth with reports of jaw pain.[3][4]","claims":[{"claim":"Hours of Falim chewing widens and strengthens the jaw","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Long chewing sessions can hurt the jaw joint","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"The enlargement can be excessive","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Masseter muscle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masseter_muscle","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Temporomandibular joint dysfunction","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temporomandibular_joint_dysfunction","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"falim hurts smth close to my ear","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/falim-hurts-smth-close-to-my-ear.54897/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Holy shit, falim is live saving","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/holy-shit-falim-is-live-saving.2022112/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mastic or falim gum which is better","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mastic-or-falim-gum-which-is-better.54940/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"}],"studies":[{"title":"Masseter muscle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masseter_muscle","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Falim gum is utter trash","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/falim-gum-is-utter-trash.55792/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://w